                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "apuli2",
                        "email": "apuli@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "apuli2"
                    },
                    "message": "Agree, But the current code doesn't move to 64 Bit support yet. So, this looks fine as it exists.\n\nChanging it to 11 can be taken care as part of 64Bit effecters addition"
                },
                {
                    "file": "include/libpldm/platform.h",
                    "line": 48,
